---
// Editorial Mission Statement Component
---

<section class="bg-[#14233B] text-white py-16 sm:py-20 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <!-- Subtle Background Motif -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-10" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="mission-dots" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <circle cx="2" cy="2" r="1.5" fill="white" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#mission-dots)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="container-main text-center">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">

      <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-sky-300 uppercase">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
        <span>Editorial Mission</span>
      </div>

      <h2 id="mission-heading" class="sr-only">Our Editorial Mission</h2>

      <blockquote class="mt-4 text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-medium leading-relaxed tracking-tight text-slate-100">
        &ldquo;Knowledge becomes powerful when it is accessible. Micro Signal Cosmos explores the ideas, discoveries and innovations shaping our world, helping readers understand complex subjects through clear, useful and thoughtful content.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-wider text-slate-400 uppercase">
        <span class="font-bold text-white">Micro Signal Cosmos</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
        <span>International Digital Publication</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

